{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_rope_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_rope_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "鲜花香水",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_rope_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9a9db258d2732c7cc400d2b49c7243fdcfecda1d7856f80b372ba12fffb7cb82",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "10:30 A.M.  天气/晴\n罗德岛本舰，四号舱室，疗养庭院"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "打扰了~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "打扰了，有人在吗——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "嗯嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "啊呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "没人在呀？你好——你好——请问——有人在吗——！哈——喽——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "欸，真没人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "这可头疼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "空手白来一趟可不是我的作风，哼哼，来都来了，就让我龙门小飞侠暗索来看看，这里都有些什么好东西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "......呃，不对！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "（拍脸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "打住，打住，暗索，收着点，不能这么干。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "（拍脸）（拍脸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "哎，习惯这东西真可怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "不过，没人在还不锁门，也太不小心了，就算丢了什么也不能怪别人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "我保证什么都不拿，就看看，看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "来让我瞧瞧，都有些什么好东西~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "嗯？地上这是什么......不懂，算了，我跳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "嚯嚯，这种花，颜色真好看，不知道值不值钱......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "哦，这个设备，很少见耶，应该也挺贵吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "还有这边的这片是......药草？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "嗯？嗯嗯？？呜啊这是什么味道，好浓郁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "有、有点头昏......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "噗——哈，好险！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "不得了，差点以为要晕过去了，这也太危险了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "怪不得曾经有前辈说过，宁可去撬龙门金库的锁，也别闯直接敞开的门，不是没有道理啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "唔，玩笑就开到这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "没人在的话，那就没办法了，难得我还想做点好事，算啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "看来只有下次再来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "什么，难道偷偷摸摸的还不止我一个呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "嘿嘿，有点意思，哪里来的小贼，让我们对决一下吧~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "悄悄摸摸悄摸悄摸......探查敌情，钩索准备——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "晨露，薄荷，碎冰沙♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "夕阳，茉莉，蜜糖花~♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "那个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "哼哼~哼~哼哼哼哼~~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "那个，打扰一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "再加一点培养素，嗯，这个量的话应该没问题！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "啊呀，太专注了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "然后再和这边的深层土混合，唔，要不然再多加一点草木灰吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "嗯嗯，好像会很不错！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "（真的完全没注意到我？安全意识有点差劲哦？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "（亏我刚刚还真以为有小偷混进来了，唉。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "嗯......平衡性好像还有点不太够，上次培育也是平衡不稳定出的问题，呼，让我想想，该怎么做......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "泥炭、赤玉......保持弱酸性......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "（还在自言自语，这样真的没问题吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "（啊，不过，旁边看着倒是还挺有意思的~）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "对了，我怎么给忘记了！还可以加入源生地带回来的砂土试试看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "嗯嗯，不管是植物还是人，都是自家才是最好的吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "（这话听起来似乎有点道理。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "（不过啊，那种好不容易飞出去，完全不想回老家的人、嗯？人？植物？算了没差别，应该也不少吧？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "咦，我把那些土壤放到哪儿去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "这里没有，也不在这里，嗯......奇怪了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "呜哇哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "欸？欸？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "怎、怎么了？什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "欸？啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "暗索......小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
